    "body": "The selected geometric cue checkpoint had legal gradient directions but a narrow update history. This executes a frozen-checkpoint discriminator comparing simultaneous one-quarter proposals at supports one and eight, with the unchanged checkpoint eligible.\n\nBoth proposals use only completed, manifest-bound development credit, ranked by absolute signed mean after legality filtering with deterministic index ties. Each starts from trial8, exports/reloads exact deltas across all960 coefficients, and produces full native canonical and actual own-prefix behavior. Actual full512 native CE selects; already-exposed128 diagnostic predictions occur only after selection. No new gradients or iterative fitting occur. Source, prefix, endpoint, panels and ordinary loss remain fixed. Every arm retains row-by-row comparisons against all earlier arms.\n\nMeasured development results (baseline / support1 / support8): nativeCE 0.98608077336532 / 0.9821585131940203 / 0.9665787502842376; source271 /272 /280 of512, firsttoken214 /214 /219, complete51 /53 /59. Support8 versusbaseline has12 source gains/3 losses,6 first-token gains/1 loss,8 completion gains/0 losses. Versussupport1 it has11 source gains/3 losses and6 completion gains/0 losses. Baseline-inclusive native CE selects support8.\n\nExposed128 composition evidence regresses: CE1.0219290489004553→1.0270479094064013; source67→65, first62→61, complete15→14 (1gain/2losses). Both-query source13/64 and complete0/64 stayflat. Preserve support8 as a development donor and the original parent; this is no chat/transfer promotion or justification for more unchanged dose.\n\nEight-coordinate support has8x coefficient L1 dose, so support and dose are confounded. No representation-impossibility or general-attention conclusion follows. Development-only record-binding/pair analysis now nominates ordered lanes5,7 for one conditional16-Q4 overlay: real same-contribution cancellation exceeds three shuffled companion controls; matched leave-bank-family-out credit agreement is407/426 versus259/426 unary in direction7→5. Joint groups are sparse (median effectivecreditrowsabout2), the ranking is a credit heuristic rather than an actual joint gradient, and no joint implementation/fit/adoption has yet occurred. Full analysis2 receipt and all exclusions remain canonical; no exposed evaluation labels selected the pair. DeepSeek owns softmax/tensor-core work; that seam is untouched.\n\nValidation: independent exact-head source review PASS e513dd28;43 fitter+49 observation release tests, fmt/build PASS, all exit0 (224.573s CPU8/RSS4,824,039,424B). Wrong-auditmanifest runtime rejection passes. Actualprobe exits0 in60.210s CPU16/RSS6,754,672,640B, Linux x86_64 host7f3628fce930. CUDA hidden; no Metal/CUDA model parity or D19 session/grading. Independent savedanalysis reconstructs ranking,960coeff deltas, frozenpayloads, selector and allarm source/first/complete/pair results. Final head65ebdfa0 changes only documentation from executed e513dd28; claim-wording/diff checks pass.\n\nCanonical EUR-NO volume lmd1pfah3y: /workspace/uor-r4/codex/cue-support-probe/{checks-1,probe-1,analysis-1}. Probe manifestac93a3c98c7e09fa92a71691351b31a2229ef7fac758624e2f4453465f86f0f7. Executableea54aac4ec190354c288876cce6b6facee70a033fb89961ca928f05ba34c0176. Selectedcue771864b7581b79a9d7b93137eb5e28e863da1361e04f41c0bf8810e442469781.\n\nStacked on PR1766. References #820 and #1552. Full60min work precharge and necessary localextension preserve priorledger charges; cumulative1,357,635,028ms/limit1,358,400,028ms. BuildCPU8/RSS8GiB; nativeCPU16/RSS12GiB/900s+30stop/report1GiB; ownpod10GiB/128MiB margin. Protected merge pending.\n",
